 "summary": "The GDT is a Greystone CO and NO2 gas detector with native BACnet MS/TP. Gas and temperature readings are Analog Inputs; buzzer, strobe and two relay alarms (setpoint, hysteresis, delay) plus sensor-life and recalibration timers are Analog Values; Binary Values enable, test and reset each function, and twelve Binary Inputs report sensor presence, alarms and service states.",
